card c04
kind: teach
type: reveal
scored: 0
title: A decay chain
predicts: c01
figure: chain-figure
figure_at: 2

body:
    A daughter can be unstable too. A [[decay-chain|decay chain]] is a sequence of radioactive decays in which one nucleus changes into another, which may decay again. It ends at a stable nucleus.

